## Enhanced Principles & Production Standards

### Perceivable (Enhanced)
- **1.4.6 Contrast (Enhanced)**: Normal text (< 24px) requires minimum **7:1** contrast; large text (≥ 24px) requires minimum **4.5:1** contrast.
- **1.4.8 Visual Presentation**:
  - Maximum line width: **80 characters** (`max-width: 75ch;`).
  - Line height: At least **1.5** within paragraphs (`line-height: 1.6;`).
  - Paragraph spacing: At least **2.25 times font size** (`margin-top: 2.25em;`).
  - **Never use `text-align: justify`**.
  - Provide user theme controls (dark/light/high-contrast modes).
- **1.4.9 Images of Text (No Exception)**: Never use raster images of text (except logos).

### Operable (Enhanced)
- **2.1.3 Keyboard (No Exception)**: Every feature and interaction must be 100% keyboard operable with zero exceptions.
- **2.2 Timing Limits**: No un-extendable timers. Session re-authentication (2.2.5) must preserve all entered form data.
- **2.3 Animations**: No flashing content (>3/sec). Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

### Understandable (Enhanced)
- **3.1.3 & 3.1.4 Jargon & Abbreviations**: Wrap technical terms in `<dfn>` with glossaries; expand all abbreviations via `<abbr title="...">`.
- **3.1.5 Reading Level**: Provide clear summaries for text exceeding lower secondary education level.
- **3.3.5 Error Prevention (All)**: All submissions must provide reversible actions, real-time validation, or a confirmation review step.
- **3.3.6 Context-Sensitive Help**: Provide helper text or accessible help popovers for every input field.
